      {
        "id": 184574,
        "name": "WarrenAC",
        "username": "WarrenAC",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/d2c977/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-11-20T00:41:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Jeysie\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/48/1868_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Jeysie:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I tried having Tachyon redirect damage a few times with Synaptic Interruption to Captain Cosmic while he did not have a Bracer on. Then I stuck Bracers on other people as usual. The unlock eventually happened after… <em>22</em> blockings of damage to other people. My brain now hurts.<a href=\"http://pastebin.com/9k8EhWud\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://pastebin.com/9k8EhWud</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Two of the blockings are double counted due to an undo of the end of Dok'Thorath environment turn, &nbsp;so this has 19 blocks against the bracer on The Scholar, &nbsp;and one against the one on Freedom Six Tachyon = our classic 20 blocks.</p>",
