      {
        "id": 184582,
        "name": "jorgenp",
        "username": "jorgenp",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/958977/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-11-20T08:27:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yay for us solving the puzzle!</p>\n<p>Boo for me having the answer 5 days ago and just assuming it was all 'non-Captain Cosmic cards' instead of going directly to just Abject Refugees first.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\"></p>\n<p>I suppose this may be my comeuppance for Haka Crushing the Abject Refugees to get them under Savage Mana in my unlock!</p>\n<p>Thanks for the help Jeysie, although I had previously thought it might just be Abject Refugees only, I needed your log to have enough info to actually suggest it might just be them.</p>\n<p>MigrantP, how did it feel watching us squirm for so long on this one being so very close?&nbsp; Also, I guess we have no more need for a hint on Monday…&nbsp; unless we cash it in on Santa Guise…&nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>",
