      {
        "id": 184585,
        "name": "Nepycros",
        "username": "Nepycros",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/8491ac/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-11-20T13:22:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Easy trick: Fight Ambuscade (low damage output) and put an Energy Bracer on Fanatic. Then, have Fanatic pop a Sonic Mine with Divine Sacrifice. With enough targets in play, that'll make for a TON of reduced damage.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You might wanna have a second Bracer, or Undaunted just to make sure Fanatic doesn't get too much damage piled up on her.</p>",
